---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Recipe & Nutrition Disclaimer | Tea & Toast"
  description="Important nutritional, allergen, and culinary disclaimer for recipes on Tea & Toast."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6">
      Recipe & Nutrition Disclaimer
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>

    <div class="prose prose-stone max-w-none text-stone-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-sm">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">1. Nutritional Information</h2>
      <p>
        Nutritional estimates provided across recipes on <strong>Tea & Toast</strong> (such as calories, grams of fat, protein, and carbohydrates) are calculated as a courtesy using automated nutritional databases and standard ingredient weights. They should be considered approximate guidelines only and not medical or dietetic prescriptions.
      </p>
      <p>
        Actual values may vary significantly depending on the specific brand of bread, cultured butter, nut butter, or seasonal produce you use, as well as portion adjustments.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">2. Food Safety & Allergens</h2>
      <p>
        Many recipes on this site involve common food allergens including wheat/gluten (sourdough, brioche, rye), dairy (butter, cheeses, ricotta, milk), tree nuts, seeds, and eggs. Readers with allergies or celiac disease are strictly responsible for verifying labels on all packaged ingredients.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">3. Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Tea & Toast monetizes through third-party advertising networks (including Google AdSense) and may occasionally participate in affiliate marketing programs. If you purchase products through affiliate links on this site, we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
